        <name>GetCredentials</name>
        <qualifiedname>paimon::CredentialProvider::GetCredentials</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Returns the credentials to sign an access with, reloading them when they are about to expire. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The keys are file system options, so a caller merges them over its own file system options with <computeroutput>MergeOptionsWithCredentials</computeroutput>. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
